houldn't do  yeah i think the lesson is that this is  still the same virus the virus hasn't  changed uh  we heard earlier this week that most of  us are still susceptible to this virus  in this country only a small percentage  of us have been infected and recovered  at this point  so people should take it very seriously  we do have to find a balance  in terms of you know living our lives in  the and  trying to get the economy moving but uh  everything that people can do as  individuals in terms of masking  physically distancing avoiding large  gatherings  we should be doing that and and  hopefully in the time ahead with more  diagnostic testing and with the  coming of new therapies and vaccines the  risk will continue to go down but for  now  you need to take this virus very  seriously  dr inglesby thank you thanks for joining  us it's always good to talk with you sir
 

